Making Unholy Water.... hmmm

I don't know off hand of ways to directly change water into
Unholy water.  You might have to try any of the following:





















Find a Cursed Potion of anything, and dilute it.
(in fact, with this, once you get one unholy water, you can
make as many as you like)

Find a level with a ghost on it, and hope the previous dead character
had some water of any flavor (or potion, for that matter)

Try to find a monster that randomly curses items in your inventory.
Risky, but it would eventually work.

Once you get one cursed potion of any kind, you can make
as many unholy waters as you like.


